{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117940","id":3461128669,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7OTKHd","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117940","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117940.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117940.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117940","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117940/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117940/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117940/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/9f1f6d2dbcfe97e40c8c72dd0e593db0a9ce55a9","number":117940,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add unit tests for Face3","user":{"login":"ioanntza22","id":52804769,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODA0NzY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52804769?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ioanntza22","html_url":"https://github.com/ioanntza22","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ioanntza22/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ioanntza22/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ioanntza22/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ioanntza22/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ioanntza22/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ioanntza22/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ioanntza22/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ioanntza22/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ioanntza22/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Adds comprehensive unit tests for the `Face3` class (`core/math/face3.h`), which currently has no test coverage.                                                                      \r\n                                                                                             \r\n  ## Tests cover                                                                             \r\n  - **Construction** — default and parameterized constructors                                \r\n  - **Degenerate detection** — collinear points, duplicate vertices                          \r\n  - **Area calculation** — unit triangle, scaled, degenerate                                 \r\n  - **Plane extraction** — clockwise and counter-clockwise winding                           \r\n  - **Ray intersection** — hit, miss, parallel, behind            \r\n  - **Segment intersection** — through face, too short, miss                                 \r\n  - **Closest point** — interior projection, nearest vertex, nearest edge, on-face           \r\n  - **Split by plane** — split into pieces, entirely one side, degenerate guard              \r\n  - **AABB intersection** — both `intersects_aabb` and `intersects_aabb2` variants           \r\n  - **Projection & support** — `project_range` with/without transform, `get_support` for face/vertex-aligned normals                                                                \r\n  - **AABB extraction** — `get_aabb` bounds correctness                                      \r\n  - **String conversion**                                                                    \r\n                                                                                             \r\n  Includes `test_face3.md` documenting every test case and its rationale.\r\n                                                                                             \r\n  Contributes to #43440.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"